+# Blue environment ownership
+
+`api-blue.keepkey.info` is assigned to the Cloudflare `keepkey-gateway` deployment.
+This repository no longer deploys, smoke-tests or rolls back the Kubernetes blue
+server. Release branches continue to build immutable legacy images; green
+promotion and rollback remain in this workflow. The `:blue` image tag is retained
+as a build compatibility tag and does not deploy a service.
+
+The workflow change must reach active release branches as well as `master`;
+cancel any older running blue rollout before retiring the old Deployment.
+See the gateway repository’s `docs/BLUE-CUTOVER.md` for the cutover and rollback.
+
 # DigitalOcean Container Registry Workflow
 
