-# Release SOP
+# Legacy Pioneer release SOP
+
+> Blue has moved to `keepkey-gateway` on Cloudflare. The legacy workflow no
+> longer deploys or rolls back Kubernetes blue. The procedure below is retained
+> as historical context; its blue deployment and smoke-test instructions must
+> not be used to validate or promote a new legacy image. Release branches still
+> build immutable `release-vX.Y.Z` images, but any green promotion requires
+> separate verification of that legacy image. Do not infer green readiness
+> from tests against the gateway at `api-blue.keepkey.info`.
+
 
 Standard operating procedure for cutting a pioneer release. Produces a `release/vX.Y.Z` branch that CI builds into `:blue` images and auto-deploys to `api-blue.keepkey.info` for staging verification before promotion to green (`master` → `api.keepkey.info`).
 
